#: src/tasks.md:5
msgid ""
"Zed supports ways to spawn (and rerun) commands using its integrated "
"[terminal](./terminal.md) to output the results. These commands can read a "
"limited subset of Zed state (such as a path to the file currently being "
"edited or selected text)."
msgstr ""

